# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ANI_KUTA_NEW — root .gitignore
# This repo holds BOTH frozen reference snapshots (_REFERENCES/)
# AND our live project (ANIKUTA_PROJECT/). The references are committed
# in full; only build artifacts & secrets are ignored.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets / credentials ──
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pem
secrets/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
google-services.json
**/credentials.json

# ── OS / editor cruft ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# ── Android / Gradle build outputs (should never be committed) ──
# These patterns apply to ANIKUTA_PROJECT/ANIKUTA once it builds.
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/captures/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.class
local.properties

# ── Kotlin / Java ──
*.hprof

# ── Logs ──
*.log
logs/
LOGCAT.MD

# ── Node / tooling (if any docs tooling is added later) ──
node_modules/

# ── NOTE: _REFERENCES/ holds frozen backup snapshots (source only, no .git).
#    Their own .gitignore files (e.g. _REFERENCES/ANIYOMI_REFRENCE/ANIYOMI/.gitignore)
#    handle Android-specific ignores should anyone accidentally build there.
#    Do NOT build inside the reference folders. See _REFERENCES/README.md.
